## What I make beyond code

<sub>The software is half of it. I also make what an organisation shows the world: reports typeset in code, promo films, pitch decks, event slides and newsletters, plus the data work and findability underneath. Open any row to see the work.</sub>

{{#each _showcase}}<details>
<summary><kbd>&nbsp;{{label}}&nbsp;</kbd>&nbsp; <sub>{{blurb}}</sub></summary>

<br>

<img src="{{collage}}" width="100%" alt="{{label}}: {{#each items}}{{title}}{{#unless @last}}; {{/unless}}{{/each}}">

{{#each items}}<p><strong>{{title}}</strong>{{#if org}} · <sub>{{org}}</sub>{{/if}}<br>
{{summary}}{{#if watchUrl}}<br><sub><a href="{{watchUrl}}">Watch the film →</a></sub>{{/if}}{{#if liveUrl}}<br><sub><a href="{{liveUrl}}">Open it live →</a></sub>{{/if}}{{#if download}}<br><sub><a href="{{download.src}}">{{download.label}} ↓</a></sub>{{/if}}</p>

{{#if quote}}
> *“{{quote.text}}”*
>
> {{#if quote.avatar}}<img src="{{quote.avatar}}" width="28" height="28" alt="{{quote.author}}">&nbsp; {{/if}}— **{{#if quote.profileUrl}}[{{quote.author}}]({{quote.profileUrl}}){{else}}{{quote.author}}{{/if}}**, {{quote.role}} · [the post]({{quote.url}})

{{/if}}
{{#each _videos}}
{{url}}

{{/each}}{{#each _pendingVideos}}<!-- VIDEO PLACEHOLDER: {{../id}} · {{label}} — upload the MP4 via GitHub user-attachments, then set videos[].url in data/profile/45-showcase.yaml -->
<p><sub>▶ <b>Film · {{label}}</b> — video coming soon</sub></p>
{{/each}}
{{/each}}
</details>
{{/each}}
